ing at the Globe<br /> Legerdemain Bunk: The Third Knuckle<br /> Legerdemain Bunk: Dance-a-jig<br /> Legerdemain Bunk: Piggie, Piggie<br /> Legerdemain Bunk: Leap of Faith<br /> Legerdemain Bunk: Moose Salute (x2)<br /> Legerdemain Bunk: Director's Cut<br /> Legerdemain Bunk: Om<br /> Primal Bunk: Willowbark (x2)<br /> Primal Bunk: Seashell<br /> Primal Bunk: Heather-wreath<br /> Primal Bunk: Honeycup<br /> Soothsay Bunk: Lucky Charms (x2)<br /> Soothsay Bunk: Dragon Bones<br /> Soothsay Bunk: Snap-bone<br /> Soothsay Bunk: Photo Shoot<br /> Sovereign Bunk: White Gloves<br /> Sovereign Bunk: Ask Nicely (x2)<br /> Sovereign Bunk: Speak Softly<br /> Sovereign Bunk: Endearment (x2)<br /> Sovereign Bunk: Ringing Shout<br /> Sovereign Bunk: Hangers-On<br /> Sovereign Bunk: Gilded Cross<br /> Wayfare Bunk: Runemarks (x2)<br /> Wayfare Bunk: Shatterglass<br /> Wayfare Bunk: Don't inhale<br /> Wayfare Bunk: Captain Puff Puff<br /> Wayfare Bunk: Krispy Kreaming<br /> Wayfare Bunk: Three Stones<br /> Nightmare: Horrid Dreams<br /> Nightmare: Clumsiness<br /> Nightmare: Headaches (x2)<br /> Nightmare: Bad Luck<br /> Nightmare: Recurring Nightmare<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T09:39:39-08:00","id":794229,"title":"","content":"I'd love to get some of the cards (I have none). How many cards are in a full set, out of curiosity?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"