about getting in touch with one another.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27091-urgthock","name":"Urgthock","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T13:00:43-07:00","id":1462314,"title":"","content":"Wow, blast from the past! I have indeed managed to complete my collection since then, and then ended up trading my spares to someone in exchange for some Arcadia: the Wyld Hunt cards I needed. If you collect the Wyld Hunt/King Ironheart's Madness cards I'm missing one of those (Male Naga character card, maybe one other, I'd have to check) and have quite a lot of duplicates to trade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-22T08:30:13-08:00","id":1471088,"title":"","content":"When I started reading this post from 2015, I suspected I'd found another dead end... but then the original poster (beccatoria) responded in recent 2021! So here is my question:<br /> <br /> You said you had completed your collection of Changeling cantrips. I collect artwork by Richard Kane Ferguson, who did art for some unknown quantity of Changeling cantrips. I have collected some of these cards (list below), but have so far been unable to determine if there are other cards I do not yet have.<br /> <br /> Are you willing and able to check your collection to see if there are any RKF cards I am missing? His artwork is quite distinct and should be fairly easy to find.<br /> <br /> I currently have:<br /> <br /> Bunk: Birds of a Feather<br /> Bunk: Captain Puff Puff<br /> Fate Fire<br /> Bunk: Freezing Wind<br /> Bunk: Lose All Glamour<br /> Manifold Chimera<br /> Quicksilver<br /> Veiled Eyes<br /> Warders Whistle<br /> Willow-Whisper<br /> <br /> Any help you can provide is greatly appreciated!<br /> <br /> Thank you,<br /> Mike","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27240-peterr211","name":"Peterr211","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-25T03:24:37-08:00","id":1471234,"title":"","content":"No problem, happy to help out. Fortunately the cards list the illustrator at the bottom so being able to identify the art style is fortunately unnecessary (especially as not all the cards have visible artist signatures). <br /> <br /> I could not see any cards illustrated by Richard Kane Ferguson beyond the ones you have already listed. It appears you have the complete set of his Cantrip Cards. Congrats!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-31T21:44:53-07:00","id":1496024,"title":"","content":"It's funny how I go looking for RKF stuff on the internet and find my old questions I'd forgotten about... Thank you for your answer! I've always been worried I was missing one!<br /> <br /> Here's an oddity - I have about 8 extra cantrip cards I acquired while picking up RKF cards... one was one of the four you were missing when you first started this thread! \ud83e\udd23","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27240-peterr211","name":"Peterr211","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-24T11:48:08-07:00","id":1560176,"title":"","content":"Hello all! I know its been years since this thread has been active, but I\u2019m looking for one more Changeling card to complete my RKF collection, if anyone has an extra of Soothsay: Fate Fire please reach out! Thanks in advance! <br /> <br /> Anthony","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29106-zursenchantedcards","name":"ZursEnchantedCards","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}